# text = In consequence of this , Margaret felt herself touched , and started up into a sitting posture ; she saw the accustomed room , the figure of Dixon in shadow , as the latter stood holding the candle a little behind her , for fear of the effect on Miss Hale's startled eyes , swollen and blinded as they were said Margaret , resuming her trembling self-restraint continued she , lifting herself languidly off the bed , yet letting her feet touch the ground without fairly standing down , as she shaded her wet ruffled hair off her face , and tried to look as though nothing were the matter ; as if she had only been asleep replied Dixon , in an aggrieved tone of voice Dixon had been so much accustomed to comment upon Mr .
