# text = To hear her father talked of in this way by a servant to her face she said , in the low tone she always used when much excited , which had a sound in it as of some distant turmoil , or threatening storm breaking far away She stood upright and firm on her feet now , confronting the waiting-maid , and fixing her with her steady discerning eye Dixon hung irresolutely about the room for a minute or two .
