# text = Hamper had said , only this very day , that if he were ruined by the strike , he would start life again , comforted by the conviction that those who brought it on were in a worse predicament than he himself ,-- for he had head as well as hands , while they had only hands ; and if they drove away their market , they could not follow it , nor turn to anything else .
