# text = He spoke as if this consequence were so entirely logical , that neither employers nor employed had any right to complain if it became their fate : the employer to turn aside from the race he could no longer run , with a bitter sense of incompetency and failure -- wounded in the struggle -- trampled down by his fellows in their haste to get rich -- slighted where he once was honoured -- humbly asking for , instead of bestowing , employment with a lordly hand .
