# text = Thornton lifted her up with a strength that was as much that of the will as of the body , and carried her away said Mr . Thornton , as he watched her out Margaret's lips formed a but he could not hear her speak , for the tramp of innumerable steps right under the very wall of the house , and the fierce growl of low deep angry voices that had a ferocious murmur of satisfaction in them , more dreadful than their baffled cries not many minutes before said he , thinking to encourage her cried Margaret , suddenly asked Mr . Thornton , coolly , and coming close to the window to discover the man in whom Margaret took such an interest .
