# text = Even while she looked , she saw lads in the back-ground stooping to take off their heavy wooden clogs -- the readiest missile they could find ; she saw it was the spark to the gunpowder , and , with a cry , which no one heard , she rushed out of the room , down stairs ,-- she had lifted the great iron bar of the door with an imperious force -- had thrown the door open wide -- and was there , in face of that angry sea of men , her eyes smiting them with flaming arrows of reproach .
