# text = Then he came back , and stood opposite to her for a moment , receiving the general impression of her beautiful presence , before he dared to disturb it , perhaps to repel it , by what he had to say said she , raising her eyes , and looking full and straight at him In spite of herself -- in defiance of her anger -- the thick blushes came all over her face , and burnt into her very eyes ; which fell not nevertheless from their grave and steady look said she , hastily he was on the verge now ; he would not speak in the haste of his hot passion ; he would weigh each word .
