# text = He threw the hand away with indignation , as he heard her icy tone ; for icy it was , though the words came faltering out , as if she knew not where to find them exclaimed he said she , with recovered dignity again the deep carnation blush , but this time with eyes kindling with indignation rather than shame she repeated , in allusion to their former conversation about that word he broke in contemptuously she replied , proudly and here the passionate tears ( kept down for long -- struggled with vehemently ) came up into her eyes , and choked her voice she replied , taking hold of the table to steady herself ; for she thought him cruel -- as , indeed , he was -- and she was weak with her indignation Margaret compressed her lips .
