# text = As far as they defied his rock-like power of character , his passion-strength , he seemed to throw them off from him with contempt , until she felt the weariness of the exertion of making useless protests ; and now , he had come , in this strange wild passionate way , to make known his love For , although at first it had struck her , that his offer was forced and goaded out of him by sharp compassion for the exposure she had made of herself ,-- which he , like others , might misunderstand -- yet , even before he left the room ,-- and certainly , not five minutes after , the clear conviction dawned upon her , shined bright upon her , that he did love her ; that he had loved her ; that he would love her .
