# text = The masters -- Mr . Thornton in particular , whose mill had been attacked by Boucher , and who , after the warrant had been issued for his apprehension on the charge of rioting , had caused it to be withdrawn ,-- the Union , of which Higgins was the representative to the poor woman ,-- the children so numerous , so hungry , and so noisy -- all made up one great army of personal enemies , whose fault it was that she was now a helpless widow .
