# text = She remembered Mr . Thornton's look of calm disdain , as in few words he gave her to understand that , in the great scheme of commerce , all dishonourable ways of acting were sure to prove injurious in the long run , and that , testing such actions simply according to the poor standard of success , there was folly and not wisdom in all such , and every kind of deceit in trade , as well as in other things .
