# text = But it was only here and there that the name came in , or any Milton name , indeed ; and Margaret was sitting one evening , all alone in the Lennoxes's drawing-room , not reading Dixon's letters , which yet she held in her hand , but thinking over them , and recalling the days which had been , and picturing the busy life out of which her own had been taken and never missed ; wondering if all went on in that whirl just as if she and her father had never been ; questioning within herself , if no one in all the crowd missed her , ( not Higgins , she was not thinking of him ,) when , suddenly , Mr . Bell was announced ; and Margaret hurried the letters into her work-basket , and started up , blushing as if she had been doing some guilty thing replied Margaret , growing very red said Margaret , resolved against making a guess asked Margaret replied Mr . Bell said Margaret , glancing down for a moment .
