# text = And yet , when he had spoken unusually well , or with remarkable epigrammatic point , she felt that his eye sought the expression of her countenance first of all , if but for an instant ; and that , in the family intercourse which constantly threw them together , her opinion was the one to which he listened with a deference ,-- the more complete , because it was reluctantly paid , and concealed as much as possible ANON .
