# text = If all the world spoke , acted , or kept silence with intent to deceive ,-- if dearest interests were at stake , and dearest lives in peril ,-- if no one should ever know of her truth or her falsehood to measure out their honour or contempt for her by , straight alone where she stood , in the presence of God , she prayed that she might have strength to speak and act the truth for evermore HOOD whispered Edith to her husband , as they were in their room alone at night after the sad journey to Oxford .
