# text = Higgins and another man stopped over-hours that night , unknown to any one , to get the neglected piece of work done ; and Mr . Thornton never knew but that the overlooker , to whom he had given the command in the first instance , had done it himself thought Higgins , one day , as he was approaching Mr . Thornton in Marlborough Street said he , stopping his employer in his quick resolved walk , and causing that gentleman to look up with a sudden annoyed start , as if his thoughts had been far away replied Mr .
